>> Animal := Objekat novi.
>> Factory := Objekat novi.

Animal na: ['novi'] uradi: {
	>> animal := sebe novi.
	animal sound: ['?']. <- animal.
}.

Animal na: ['sound:'] uradi: { :s
	svoj sound := s.
}.

Animal na: ['sound'] uradi: { <- svoj sound.
}.

>> Dog := Objekat novi.
>> Cat := Objekat novi.

Dog na: ['novi'] uradi: { <- Animal novi sound: ['woof!'].
}.

Cat na: ['novi'] uradi: { <- Animal novi sound: ['meow!'].
}.

Izlaz piši: Dog novi sound, novi-red.
Izlaz piši: Cat novi sound, novi-red.

Factory na: ['mix:and:'] uradi: { :beast1 :beast2 <- Animal novi sound: (
		( beast1 sound od: 0 dužina: 2 ) +
		( beast2 sound od: 2 dužina: 5 )
	).
}.

Izlaz piši: (Factory mix: Dog novi and: Cat novi) sound, novi-red.
